{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"30048260eddb1696815783179717f0ede7455c32c7bc64f69af228ec26919cf3","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP HTTP transport / nginx edge proxy","key_entities":["infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template","infra/compose/docker-compose.yml","src/rebar/mcp_server.py","src/rebar/_mcp_health.py","tests/unit/test_mcp_on_box_infra.py","tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_http_transport.py","FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS","location = /mcp/","location = /mcp","proxy_redirect","Strict-Transport-Security","proxy_pass http://rebar_mcp/mcp","redirect_slashes","ProxyHeadersMiddleware"],"problem_keywords":["https redirect downgrade","307 redirect","http scheme exposure","bearer token plaintext","HSTS missing","nginx configuration","trailing slash redirect"],"propositions":["The documented MCP client URL https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/mcp/ (with trailing slash) returns HTTP 307 to plaintext http://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/mcp, exposing bearer PAT credentials in plaintext","Nginx prefix location /mcp with URI-preserving proxy_pass reaches the app at /mcp/ while the app mounts at /mcp, triggering Starlette's redirect_slashes 307 redirect","uvicorn's FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS defaults to 127.0.0.1 but the containerized MCP service connects from the Docker bridge gateway, causing X-Forwarded-Proto headers to be dropped and scheme-derived URLs to become http://","The nginx 443 server lacks an HSTS header, providing no backstop to upgrade accidental http:// downgrades back to https","The fix requires exact-match nginx locations for /mcp/ and /mcp proxying to http://rebar_mcp/mcp, proxy_redirect rules, server-level HSTS with always flag, and FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS=* on the mcp compose service"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787889686026252001,"uuid":"986f437d-40b0-4f6e-8931-bd58a5c55863"}